      "simplified": "你知道拼音“n”、“l”发音的不同吗？",
      "traditional": "你知道拼音“n”、“l”發音的不同嗎？",
      "pinyin": "nǐ zhī dào pīn yīn 1 1 fā yīn de bù tóng ma",
      "english": "Can you hear the difference in pronunciation between the two characters “ni” and “li”?"
    },
    {
