      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Do you know the difference between the pinyin “n” and “l”?"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "很多人都说中文发音很难，",
      "traditional": "很多人都說中文發音很難，",
      "pinyin": "hěn duō rén dōu shuō zhōng wén fā yīn hěn nán",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "其实不单是外国人，有些中国人也觉得中文发音很难。",
      "traditional": "其實不單是外國人，有些中國人也覺得中文發音很難。",
      "pinyin": "qí shí bù dān shì wài guó rén yǒu xiē zhōng guó rén yě jué de zhōng wén fā yīn hěn nán",
      "english": "A lot of people think pronouncing Chinese is very difficult."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "因为受方言的影响，有些地方的人说普通话不是特别标准。",
      "traditional": "因為受方言的影響，有些地方的人說普通話不是特別標準。",
      "pinyin": "yīn wèi shòu fāng yán de yǐng xiǎng yǒu xiē dì fang de rén shuō pǔ tōng huà bú shì tè bié biāo zhǔn",
      "english": "Actually it is not just foreigners: some Chinese people also think the Chinese pronunciation is difficult."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "比如，湖南、广西等地有些人“n”、“l”不分，",
      "traditional": "比如，湖南、廣西等地有些人“n”、“l”不分，",
      "pinyin": "bǐ rú hú nán guǎng xī děng dì yǒu xiē rén 1 1 bù fēn",
      "english": "Due to strong influences from dialects, mandarin spoken by people in some areas is not very standard."
    },
    {
