      "simplified": "他们常把“牛奶”读成“liú lǎi”。",
      "traditional": "他們常把“牛奶”讀成“liú lǎi”。",
      "pinyin": "tā men cháng bǎ niú nǎi dú chéng 1 1",
      "english": "For example, in Hunan and Guangxi there are people who do not distinguish between “n” and “l”."
